{"route":"/docs/6.0/components/close-button/","version":"6.0","renderedVersion":"6.0","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Close button","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"A generic close button for dismissing content like modals and alerts."},"blocks":[{"id":"example","type":"heading","en":"Example","level":2},{"id":"example--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Provide an option to dismiss or close a component with <code>.btn-close</code>. The icon is rendered with a CSS <code>mask-image</code>, so it inherits the <code>color</code> from the <code>.btn-close</code> class—no inline SVG required. <strong>Be sure to include text for screen readers</strong>, as we’ve done with <code>aria-label</code>."},{"id":"example--example-1","type":"demo","key":"3c2ac68713706ee0ee18","height":147},{"id":"example--code-1","type":"code","value":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>","language":""},{"id":"disabled-state","type":"heading","en":"Disabled state","level":2},{"id":"disabled-state--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Disabled close buttons change their <code>opacity</code>. We’ve also applied <code>pointer-events: none</code> and <code>user-select: none</code> to preventing hover and active states from triggering."},{"id":"disabled-state--example-1","type":"demo","key":"b6ecef8558e843999db4","height":147},{"id":"disabled-state--code-1","type":"code","value":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" disabled aria-label=\"Close\"></button>","language":""},{"id":"dark-variant","type":"heading","en":"Dark variant","level":2},{"id":"dark-variant--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>data-bs-theme=&quot;dark&quot;</code> to the <code>.btn-close</code>, or to its parent element, to invert the close button. This happens automatically when in dark mode."},{"id":"dark-variant--example-1","type":"demo","key":"95118d2a8834fa64b584","height":147},{"id":"dark-variant--code-1","type":"code","value":"<div data-bs-theme=\"dark\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" disabled aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n</div>","language":""},{"id":"css","type":"heading","en":"CSS","level":2},{"id":"variables","type":"heading","en":"Variables","level":3},{"id":"variables--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Close button use local CSS variables on <code>.btn-close</code> for real-time customization. Values for the CSS variables are generated from Sass maps unique to each component and applied to the aforementioned class."},{"id":"variables--code-1","type":"code","value":"// stylelint-disable-next-line scss/dollar-variable-default\n$btn-close-tokens: defaults(\n  (\n    --btn-close-size: 1.25rem,\n    --btn-close-color: inherit,\n    --btn-close-icon: #{escape-svg(url(\"data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 16 16'><path d='M12 0a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v8a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H4a4 4 0 0 1-4-4V4a4 4 0 0 1 4-4zm-.646 4.646a.5.5 0 0 0-.707 0L8 7.293 5.354 4.646a.5.5 0 1 0-.708.708L7.293 8l-2.647 2.647a.5.5 0 1 0 .708.707L8 8.707l2.647 2.646a.5.5 0 1 0 .707-.707L8.707 8l2.646-2.646a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.708z'/></svg>\"))},\n    --btn-close-opacity: .5,\n    --btn-close-hover-opacity: .75,\n    --btn-close-focus-opacity: .85,\n    --btn-close-disabled-opacity: .25,\n  ),\n  $btn-close-tokens\n);","language":""}],"demos":[{"key":"3c2ac68713706ee0ee18","html":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"b6ecef8558e843999db4","html":"<button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example"},"sprite":""},{"key":"95118d2a8834fa64b584","html":"<div data-bs-theme=\"dark\">\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n  <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn-close\" disabled=\"\" aria-label=\"Close\"></button>\n</div>","attrs":{"class":"bd-example bg-inverse"},"sprite":""}],"nav":[{"en":"Install","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/install"},{"en":"AI","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/ai"},{"en":"Approach","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/approach"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/css-variables"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/javascript"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/browsers-devices"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/getting-started/accessibility"},{"en":"Quickstart","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/quickstart"},{"en":"npm","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/npm"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/webpack"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/parcel"},{"en":"Vite","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/vite"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/contribute"},{"en":"Migration","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/guides/migration"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/overview"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/sass"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/options"},{"en":"Color","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/color"},{"en":"Theme","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/theme"},{"en":"Color modes","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/color-modes"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/components"},{"en":"TransitionsNew (Added in v6.0.0)","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/transitions"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/6.0/customize/rtl"},{"en":"Optimize","href":"https://getbootstrap